WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:02.667
-Hey, guys, right now it's time
to look at these stories

00:00:02.667 --> 00:00:05.033
making headlines today, and
weigh the good with the bad.

00:00:05.033 --> 00:00:07.033
It's time for "Pros and Cons."
Here we go.

00:00:07.033 --> 00:00:12.501
-♪ Pros and cons
and pros and cons and pros ♪

00:00:12.501 --> 00:00:13.901
-Now, tonight
we'll be taking a look

00:00:13.901 --> 00:00:17.000
at the pros and the cons
of being the Batman.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.234
-Ooh.
-It's the number-one movie

00:00:19.234 --> 00:00:20.501
right now
everyone is talking about.

00:00:20.501 --> 00:00:23.200
Let's look at the pros and cons
of being the Batman.

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:24.567
Here we go.

00:00:24.567 --> 00:00:27.133
Pro -- hearing people say,
"Whoa, it's Batman!"

00:00:27.133 --> 00:00:28.434
[ Laughter ]

00:00:28.434 --> 00:00:30.667
Con -- having to correct them
by saying, "Um, actually,

00:00:30.667 --> 00:00:32.100
it's 'The Batman'?"

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:35.234
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:35.234 --> 00:00:36.734
No big deal.

00:00:36.734 --> 00:00:38.667
Pro -- responding
to the Bat Signal.

00:00:38.667 --> 00:00:41.167
Con -- realizing
this could have been a Zoom.

00:00:41.167 --> 00:00:42.934
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:42.934 --> 00:00:44.667
Could have been.

00:00:44.667 --> 00:00:46.701
Pro -- Colin Farrell
spent eight hours

00:00:46.701 --> 00:00:48.534
putting on makeup
to play The Penguin.

00:00:48.534 --> 00:00:51.467
Con -- Robert Pattinson
just walked into a Sephora

00:00:51.467 --> 00:00:53.033
and said, "Go nuts."

00:00:53.033 --> 00:00:55.601
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:55.601 --> 00:00:57.400
-Healthy guy.

00:00:57.400 --> 00:01:00.367
-Uh, pro -- winning
against the Riddler.

00:01:00.367 --> 00:01:02.200
Con -- failing
against the Wordler.

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:04.701
Oh.
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:04.701 --> 00:01:05.734
I didn't know it was a villain.
Was it?

00:01:05.734 --> 00:01:07.200
-Wow. Wordle?

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:09.567
-Pro -- wearing the Batman mask.

00:01:09.567 --> 00:01:11.567
Con -- spending 45 minutes
trying to get

00:01:11.567 --> 00:01:13.534
your iPhone Face ID
to recognize you.

00:01:13.534 --> 00:01:17.501
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:17.501 --> 00:01:21.701
Pro -- saving the world
one day the a time.

00:01:21.701 --> 00:01:24.467
Con -- not being able
to brag about it on Instagram.

00:01:24.467 --> 00:01:26.801
It's like, "So, this happened."

00:01:26.801 --> 00:01:28.234
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:28.234 --> 00:01:31.634
Pro -- saying, "I am vengeance.
I am the night."

00:01:31.634 --> 00:01:34.100
Con -- hearing the
Starbucks barista say, "Okay,

00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:36.667
either way, your
caramel macchiato is ready.

00:01:36.667 --> 00:01:38.834
So, night, vengeance, whatever.
Take it."

00:01:38.834 --> 00:01:40.367
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:40.367 --> 00:01:42.133
Pro -- defeating The Joker.

00:01:42.133 --> 00:01:43.501
Con -- having to face
his henchmen,

00:01:43.501 --> 00:01:45.267
The Smoker and
The Midnight Toker.

00:01:45.267 --> 00:01:47.901
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:47.901 --> 00:01:49.801
-Come on.

00:01:49.801 --> 00:01:51.801
Some people call him
The Space Cowboy, too.

00:01:51.801 --> 00:01:54.601
-A little Steve Miller reference
right there.

00:01:54.601 --> 00:01:56.634
-Some people call him Maurice.
-Ah.

00:01:56.634 --> 00:01:58.033
[ Laughter ]

00:01:58.033 --> 00:02:00.133
-And finally, pro --
see the Bat Signal

00:02:00.133 --> 00:02:01.567
shining across the sky.

00:02:01.567 --> 00:02:03.667
Con -- getting a text message
from Commissioner Gordon

00:02:03.667 --> 00:02:05.467
5 seconds later
that says, "U up?"

00:02:05.467 --> 00:02:07.467
There you have it.
Those are the pros and cons.

